Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結如絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.30,0:02:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮 祈裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.50,0:02:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,簡直像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.00,0:02:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼 爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.62,0:02:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}新娘人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.70,0:02:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個時候沒有察覺吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.90,0:02:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽瞳孔中那詭異的光芒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.70,0:02:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.90,0:02:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼晚了你在做什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想給鯉魚餵食
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.00,0:02:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種事情交給下人做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不幹家務活也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.80,0:03:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天涼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.80,0:03:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了避免感冒你先去洗澡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽 媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胖了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.10,0:03:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你胖了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會原諒的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.40,0:03:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不允許胖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.50,0:03:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.60,0:03:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 對不起 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.00,0:04:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起風了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.60,0:04:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭的風
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,燥熱夾雜着陰冷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這樣的夜裏總有人哭泣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.90,0:04:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 祈裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.10,0:04:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.40,0:05:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情平靜了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.40,0:05:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.40,0:05:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.60,0:05:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 媽媽也不是恨你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.20,0:05:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲她覺得氏家的新娘一定要漂亮地嫁進來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是那種人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.60,0:05:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且重要的展覽會又在眼前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.90,0:05:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很興奮吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醜陋 那麼醜陋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.40,0:05:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽是日本引以爲傲的優秀人偶製作師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也嫁到了不得了的人家裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只要有幸雄在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 明天也要早起 休息吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近可能是疲勞了些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.00,0:06:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按摩的話你跟我說我也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在鏡月院學過 還算拿手的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.30,0:06:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那裏的事就忘記吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.80,0:06:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已經不必做那些事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲你是重要的新娘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 讓我做點什麼吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.40,0:06:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我嫁過來就像是客人一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.80,0:06:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼明天你來做早飯吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.70,0:06:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸雄 早飯做好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈裏 我應該說過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.90,0:07:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不幹家務活也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 祈裏也趁熱快喫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.30,0:07:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我給祈裏準備了別的東西喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個人稍微胖了一點點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.40,0:07:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.70,0:07:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說坐下你聽不見嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.10,0:07:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把背挺起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.20,0:07:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.10,0:07:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身邊的事無論什麼下人都會做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.00,0:07:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就安安靜靜地坐着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美麗 婀娜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 祈裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.20,0:08:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸雄 救救我 請救救我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼了 祈裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.10,0:08:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕 太可怕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽的眼神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.40,0:08:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人說讓你清醒一下頭腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排除內心的雜念
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.00,0:08:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,內心的雜念
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.80,0:08:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上衣服試試嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 還不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的眼神還沒有死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.40,0:08:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣還不能稱爲死亡人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不會與壽服相稱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.00,0:08:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要的是充滿了悲哀與絕望的人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.40,0:09:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 果然來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請原諒我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請原諒我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.70,0:09:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想見大家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 你又
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了 在哭的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.40,0:09:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大約是高中生吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起來像人偶一樣美人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.10,0:09:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.90,0:10:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.10,0:10:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮 祈裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安安靜靜地坐着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.70,0:10:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在怕什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.30,0:10:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前就一直被那個人注視着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從小時候開始就一直
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.10,0:10:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挺可愛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.50,0:10:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,長大了到我們家來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.40,0:10:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都爲我高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.60,0:10:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一個孤兒能嫁到那麼好的人家去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.00,0:10:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你恨的是那家的那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.40,0:10:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.40,0:11:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修女也一直這麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還要堅持嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想讓別人不幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能不管吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是那是當事人的希望對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.30,0:11:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這種情況下指明方向纔是大人的職責
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是大人不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.80,0:12:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 就是那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.00,0:12:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦 我擅自出來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.00,0:12:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過你很想逃走纔出來的 不是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點走吧 在這裏不妙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 已經不哭了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼 爲什麼你知道我在哭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.60,0:13:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是雖然不知道不過能知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.50,0:13:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰和地獄少女聯繫上的話我就能感覺到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.10,0:13:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你無論如何都要送誰下地獄嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.90,0:13:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過詛咒他人最終自己也要下地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.10,0:13:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己下地獄無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過不能讓鏡月院的各位流淚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鏡月院就是這裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在這裏成長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.80,0:13:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這裏的時候曾想盡早看看外面的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在卻覺得這裏好親切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.30,0:13:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後支持着我們的家的是氏家鏡月老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是我媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.10,0:13:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很感激
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也祝福我嫁入她家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.10,0:14:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你卻在忍受着什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼都
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼都不被允許
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.90,0:14:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是讓我像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.70,0:14:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起來不是你一個人解決的問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.20,0:14:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建議你和這裏的人好好談談
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.10,0:14:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好說的話能體諒的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.00,0:14:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要說的話我肯定會都說出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:43.20,0:14:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到什麼難過的事的話隨時都可以回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但這裏的人真的都很溫柔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很珍惜我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.80,0:14:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不能說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不忍的話這個家就沒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.50,0:15:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你找了地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.40,0:15:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,緊急出口是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,緊急的時候誰都可以用的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.90,0:15:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.20,0:15:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對我來說緊急出口就是地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有沒有我們可以做到的事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.00,0:15:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望有人幫你纔跟我們來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子不會解開繩子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.00,0:15:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲她最看重這裏的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.50,0:15:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是這樣好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.00,0:15:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犧牲自己 好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.60,0:16:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今後她一定也會很痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 祈裏她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 今天可以退下了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.20,0:16:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.70,0:16:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到哪裏去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.90,0:16:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去散步了一會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 散步
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.70,0:16:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法 因爲你的腿很能動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和人偶不同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那雙腿不能動就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的人偶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.40,0:17:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照我希望的去做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人偶不需要有心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.10,0:17:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這雙眼多麼漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.40,0:17:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年輕美麗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.40,0:17:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是死亡人偶的一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了啊　女人好可怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.90,0:17:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你現在才明白嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.50,0:17:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 請原諒我修女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經不能祈禱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不能懺悔了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那個人不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.30,0:18:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不把人當人 而像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.80,0:18:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也會痛 會憤怒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.90,0:18:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能成爲那個人的人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈裏 你在和誰說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.90,0:18:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼大聲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很擔心你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.10,0:18:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.60,0:18:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會和幸雄生活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也老了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.80,0:19:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是勝不了年紀的 老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你羨慕人偶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.00,0:19:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠美麗不會變老的人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.70,0:19:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.50,0:20:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不會讓你死的那麼簡單的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.30,0:20:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你癡迷人偶是無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但人可不是人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和人偶比起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.40,0:20:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人簡直就是既膚淺又醜陋的歪門邪道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人偶纔是我的一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.80,0:20:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 人偶的生死都由我掌握
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我纔是神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,該小姐上場了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.50,0:21:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.40,0:21:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.80,0:21:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮 就像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真想做一個 像你一樣的人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.10,0:21:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定和壽服很相配
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會讓你永遠在那個世界裏做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.60,0:21:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過模特只是你自己的死態
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:55.10,0:21:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多麼漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.70,0:22:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.90,0:22:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸雄 今後我會連媽媽的份一起好好待你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.10,0:22:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身與心都
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.80,0:22:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種不需要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.90,0:22:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要一直看着我就可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.60,0:22:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像人偶一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:44.10,0:22:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最終還是個可悲的人偶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:47.90,0:22:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人間地獄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.00,0:23:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:16.10,0:23:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.60,0:23:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.50,0:23:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.60,0:23:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.40,0:24:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.40,0:24:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.30,0:24:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.50,0:24:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.40,0:24:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路 多 隆菲爾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:38.00,0:24:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是從地獄回來的男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.00,0:24:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想見我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:42.50,0:24:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 想見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.70,0:24:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我不認爲你比我有力量
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.60,0:24:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過也有事想問你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.00,0:25:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}地獄少女對地獄少年
